#: scripts/scenario_23_pirate.lua:4412
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "Avast, me hearties."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_23_pirate.lua:4413
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "The pirate code's more like guidelines than actual rules."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_23_pirate.lua:4414
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "Where aarrrr they going?"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_23_pirate.lua:4415
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "It's bad form to shoot a man in the middle of his cadenza."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_23_pirate.lua:4416
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "There's a bit of bravery in everyone, even if they don't know it."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_23_pirate.lua:4417
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "A good pirate never shows his true colors."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_23_pirate.lua:4418
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "It's not the size of the ship, but the captain's heart that matters."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_23_pirate.lua:4419
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid ""
"Always remember, laughter is the best medicine, especially when you're "
"sailing through tough times."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_23_pirate.lua:4420
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "Not all treasure is silver and gold."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_23_pirate.lua:4421
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "Why join the navy if you can be a pirate?"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_23_pirate.lua:4422
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "Work like a captain, play like a pirate."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_23_pirate.lua:4423
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "May your blade always be wet and your powder dry."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_23_pirate.lua:4424
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "Ahoy matey! Let's trouble the water!"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_23_pirate.lua:4425
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "Shiver me timbers."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_23_pirate.lua:4426
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "Avast, ye scurvy dog."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_23_pirate.lua:4427
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "Batten down the hatches."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_23_pirate.lua:4428
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "Here be treasure, matey."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_23_pirate.lua:4429
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "Yo ho ho and a bottle of coolant."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_23_pirate.lua:4430
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "A merry life and a short one shall be my motto."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_23_pirate.lua:4431
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "Every generation welcomes the pirates from the last."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_23_pirate.lua:4432
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "When a pirate grows rich enough, they make him a prince."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_23_pirate.lua:4433
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "It is when pirates count their booty that they become mere thieves."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_23_pirate.lua:4434
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "Take what you can, give nothing back."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_23_pirate.lua:4435
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid ""
"In politics and trade, bruisers and pirates are of better promise than "
"talkers and clerks."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_23_pirate.lua:4436
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "I am a man of fortune and must seek my fortune."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_23_pirate.lua:4437
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "In an honest service, there is thin commons, low wages, and hard labor."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_23_pirate.lua:4438
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid ""
"Revenge may sate your being, but don't misunderstand me. It's an end, not a "
"beginning."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_23_pirate.lua:4439
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid ""
"Betrayin's all part of piratin'. If you don't know that, you're not even "
"close to being a pirate."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_23_pirate.lua:4440
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "Aye, the sea whispers secrets only the brave dare to listen."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_23_pirate.lua:4441
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "Ye have the heart of a sea serpentcold and deep as the abyss itself."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_23_pirate.lua:4442
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "Weigh anchor! The dawn's light brings promise of plunder and glory."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_23_pirate.lua:4443
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid ""
"Let the sea's song guide us to untold riches, hidden where X marks the spot."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_23_pirate.lua:4444
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "Marooned by fate, saved by wit and willsuch is the pirate's plight."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_23_pirate.lua:4445
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid ""
"A chest of gold, a bottle of rum, and a sky alight with starspirate's "
"paradise."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_23_pirate.lua:4446
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid ""
"Coolant's the fuel that stirs the soul and emboldens the spirit of adventure."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_23_pirate.lua:4447
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "A sword's edge and a cunning mind carve the path to treasures untold."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_23_pirate.lua:4448
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid ""
"Let no man be called a landlubber when the call of the ocean beckons his "
"heart."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_23_pirate.lua:4449
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid ""
"The code of the sea is written in the blood of those who dare to defy it."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_23_pirate.lua:4450
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid ""
"Only in the dead of night, under the moon's watchful eye, do true pirates "
"ply their trade."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_23_pirate.lua:4451
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid ""
"The call of the deep is a siren's song, luring the unwary to their doom or "
"glory."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_23_pirate.lua:4452
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid ""
"In the shadow of the mast, we find solace in the brotherhood of outcasts."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_23_pirate.lua:4453
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid ""
"The gleam of treasure is not in its worth, but in the adventure it promises."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_23_pirate.lua:4454
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid "Gold and glory, the twin sirens that lead us through peril to paradise."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_23_pirate.lua:4455
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid ""
"Let our laughter echo across the waves, a testament to the joy found in "
"lawlessness."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/scenario_23_pirate.lua:4456
msgctxt "smee-msgRelay"
msgid ""
"We are the shadows that slip through the night, the whisper of danger on the "
"wind."
msgstr ""

